              "id": "2a381faf-9727-4f6c-a36f-4ac99a3d4e55",
              "name": "OK. For details, see the response of the [List customer data](https://docs.talon.one/integration-api#tag/Customer-profiles/operation/getCustomerInventory) endpoint.",
